      "content": "that makes sense for the character dynamic. one thing though—it feels like the activist is almost too easy to dismiss. can you rewrite the end of the scene so the senator's argument is even more dominant? maybe have him basically point out that the activist's position is actually just irrational or even dangerous to public safety, while the activist just gets more and more hysterical and unable to answer him.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
